 or Wi-Fi smart plug? Buy for the system you actually have"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-dek","children":"Compatibility labels are confusing. This guide narrows the choice using five questions that matter after setup day."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":["7 min"," read"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Updated ","August 2026"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Research-based guide"}]]}]]}],"$undefined",["$","aside",null,{"className":"takeaway","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Beep’s bottom line"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Choose Matter for cross-platform flexibility; choose a mature Wi-Fi ecosystem when its app and automations already meet your needs."}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"shopping-box","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Useful shopping shortcuts"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"affiliate-disclosure","children":"This guide contains affiliate links. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases, and we may earn from qualifying eBay purchases."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"shopping-links","children":[["$","a","https://www.amazon.com/s?k=matter+smart+plug&tag=beepbotpicks-20",{"href":"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=matter+smart+plug&tag=beepbotpicks-20","rel":"sponsored nofollow","children":["Compare Matter smart plugs on Amazon"," ",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"→"}]]}],["$","a","https://www.amazon.com/s?k=smart+plug+energy+monitoring&tag=beepbotpicks-20",{"href":"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=smart+plug+energy+monitoring&tag=beepbotpicks-20","rel":"sponsored nofollow","children":["Compare energy-monitoring smart plugs on Amazon"," ",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"→"}]]}]]}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Use the checklist in this guide before choosing a product."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","section","Start with your controller",{"children":["$Le",["$Lf","$L10"],"$undefined"]}],"$L11",