f:["$","p","Matter is a compatibility standard, not a complete smart-home system. You still need a compatible controller from the platform you use, and some Matter devices require a Thread border router while others connect over Wi-Fi.",{"children":"Matter is a compatibility standard, not a complete smart-home system. You still need a compatible controller from the platform you use, and some Matter devices require a Thread border router while others connect over Wi-Fi."}]
10:["$","p","Check the exact model of your hub, speaker, or streaming box before buying. A logo on the plug does not guarantee every advanced feature appears in every app.",{"children":"Check the exact model of your hub, speaker, or streaming box before buying. A logo on the plug does not guarantee every advanced feature appears in every app."}]
11:["$","section","Five questions that settle the choice",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Five questions that settle the choice"}],[["$","p","Answer these before comparing brands or multipacks.",{"children":"Answer these before comparing brands or multipacks."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Will more than one household platform need to control the plug?",{"children":"Will more than one household platform need to control the plug?"}],["$","li","Do you need energy monitoring, and does your chosen app expose it?",{"children":"Do you need energy monitoring, and does your chosen app expose it?"}],["$","li","Must schedules continue when the internet is down?",{"children":"Must schedules continue when the internet is down?"}],["$","li","Is the plug narrow enough to leave the second outlet usable?",{"children":"Is the plug narrow enough to leave the second outlet usable?"}],["$","li","Does its electrical rating safely cover the intended device?",{"children":"Does its electrical rating safely cover the intended device?"}]]}]]}]
12:["$","section","When ordinary Wi-Fi is the better buy",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"When ordinary Wi-Fi is the better buy"}],[["$","p","A reliable Wi-Fi plug can be the simpler choice when you already use the manufacturer's app, need a feature that is not exposed through Matter, or do not own a suitable Matter controller.",{"children":"A reliable Wi-Fi plug can be the simpler choice when you already use the manufacturer's app, need a feature that is not exposed through Matter, or do not own a suitable Matter controller."}],["$","p","Avoid building a home around an unknown vendor's cloud. Look for a clear privacy policy, recent app updates, physical controls, and a usable deletion process.",{"children":"Avoid building a home around an unknown vendor's cloud. Look for a clear privacy policy, recent app updates, physical controls, and a usable deletion process."}]],"$undefined"]}]
